  "Battle 44″×60″ (11th edition maps)": "Bitwa 44″×60″ (mapy 11. edycji)",
  "Battle Focus (Asuryani army rule): at the start of each round — 2 tokens (Incursion). The Swift as the Wind manoeuvre is implemented: a token gives +2″ to a normal move, Advance or Fall Back. [Reactive manoeuvres are not implemented: Fade Back, Opportunity Seized, Flitting Shadows, Sudden Strike, Star Engines.]": "Skupienie bojowe (Battle Focus, zasada armii Asuryani): na początku każdej rundy — 2 żetony (Incursion). Zaimplementowano manewr Swift as the Wind: żeton daje +2″ do zwykłego ruchu, natarcia lub odwrotu. [Nie zaimplementowano manewrów reaktywnych: Fade Back, Opportunity Seized, Flitting Shadows, Sudden Strike, Star Engines.]",
  "Battle Focus: a token gives +2″ to movement": "Skupienie bojowe: żeton daje +2″ do ruchu",
